  "description": "A composable information retrieval toolkit for .NET: in-memory inverted index, BM25/TF-IDF/query-likelihood/boolean scorers, rank fusion (RRF, cascade, MMR, MaxSim, cross-encoder) and model-agnostic dense/learned-sparse seams, plus IR metrics, BM25 tuning and end-to-end search traces. The core package has no runtime dependency.",
